codex-weixin is a clean-room independent WeChat bridge for OpenAI Codex.

Codex for WeChat is a derivative distribution based on codex-weixin v0.3.8
by Xuechao Zou. The upstream MIT license and copyright notice are retained.
This distribution adds sender-bound approvals, task interruption, and
controlled browser tools. Its source is published at:
https://github.com/WeihaoYYY/Codex-for-WeChat

The project structure and protocol boundaries were informed by the MIT-licensed
Tencent/openclaw-weixin package and by public documentation in the WeChat/Codex
bridge ecosystem. Source code from AGPL-licensed projects is not copied.
